https://github.com/cedar-policy/cedar, at commit
5af7b8cd78e4e0da3ae23f1715023fff8e62941d.
They are licensed under Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE at the repository root).
partial-decision.accord ports PartialResponse::decision, with collection
nonemptiness as Boolean parameters and Option<Decision> as an enum.
policy-set.accord ports how a policy set's evaluation reaches a decision,
partial and concrete, with each policy as its effect and the result of
evaluating it; it does not port evaluating a policy's conditions.
Each cedar-*-fault folder holds the same ports with one planted fault.
